Runic_Boulder;Призывает ~w~рунический валун~/~. Валун притягивает врагов в области ~w~5x5~/~ к точке падения и наносит ~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/ истинного урона~/~.##Каждый валун в поле зрения даёт заклинателю 1 заряд ~lg~рунической силы~/~.##Валун рушится, если находится вне поля зрения заклинателя ~w~5~/~ ходов подряд или если у заклинателя нет энергии ~w~2~/~ хода подряд.##Базовый предел: ~w~3~/~ валуна, каждый другой открытый навык геомантии увеличивает предел на ~w~1~/~.##Валуны одного владельца на расстоянии до ~w~7~/~ клеток притягиваются друг к другу, сталкиваются, отталкивают существ на пути и наносят ~p~истинный урон~/~.;Summons a ~w~Runic Boulder~/~. The boulder pulls enemies in a ~w~5x5~/~ area toward its landing point and deals ~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/ True Damage~/~.##Each visible boulder grants the caster 1 stack of ~lg~Runic Power~/~.##The boulder collapses after staying outside the caster's vision for ~w~5~/~ consecutive turns or after the caster has no Energy for ~w~2~/~ consecutive turns.##Base limit is ~w~3~/~ boulders, each other opened Geomancy skill increases it by ~w~1~/~.##Boulders owned by the same caster within ~w~7~/~ tiles attract each other, collide, shove units along their paths, and deal ~p~True Damage~/~.;在所选方格召唤一块~w~符文巨石~/~，巨石落下时会吸引周围~w~5x5~/~范围内的敌人并造成~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/点真实伤害~/~。##视野之内每有一块符文巨石，施法者便获得1层~lg~符文强化~/~：##法力~lg~+5%~/~#地术法力~lg~+10%~/~#能力精力消耗~lg~-10%~/~#精力恢复~r~/*MP_turn*/~/~##基础上限为~w~3~/~块巨石；每额外开启1个其它地系技能，上限~lg~+1~/~。##如果~w~巨石~/~脱离施法者的视野连续~w~5~/~回合，或施法者精力耗尽连续~w~2~/~回合，那么~w~巨石~/~崩塌。##同一施法者的符文巨石彼此距离不超过~w~7~/~格时会互相牵引并合并，沿途挤开单位并造成~p~真实伤害~/~；靠近合并点的单位受到更高伤害，合并后的冲击会反作用于巨石。;Beschwört einen ~w~Runenstein~/~. Der Stein zieht Gegner in einem Bereich von ~w~5x5~/~ zu seinem Einschlagspunkt und verursacht ~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/ wahren Schaden~/~.##Jeder sichtbare Stein gewährt dem Zaubernden 1 Stapel ~lg~Runenkraft~/~.##Der Stein zerfällt nach ~w~5~/~ aufeinanderfolgenden Runden außerhalb der Sicht oder nach ~w~2~/~ Runden ohne Energie.##Das Grundlimit beträgt ~w~3~/~ Steine, jede andere freigeschaltete Geomantie-Fertigkeit erhöht es um ~w~1~/~.##Steine desselben Besitzers innerhalb von ~w~7~/~ Feldern ziehen sich an, kollidieren, verdrängen Einheiten auf dem Weg und verursachen ~p~wahren Schaden~/~.;Summons a ~w~Runic Boulder~/~. The boulder pulls enemies in a ~w~5x5~/~ area toward its landing point and deals ~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/ True Damage~/~.##Each visible boulder grants the caster 1 stack of ~lg~Runic Power~/~.##The boulder collapses after staying outside the caster's vision for ~w~5~/~ consecutive turns or after the caster has no Energy for ~w~2~/~ consecutive turns.##Base limit is ~w~3~/~ boulders, each other opened Geomancy skill increases it by ~w~1~/~.##Boulders owned by the same caster within ~w~7~/~ tiles attract each other, collide, shove units along their paths, and deal ~p~True Damage~/~.;Invoque un ~w~Rocher runique~/~. Le rocher attire les ennemis dans une zone de ~w~5x5~/~ vers son point d'impact et inflige ~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/ dégâts bruts~/~.##Chaque rocher visible octroie 1 cumul de ~lg~Puissance runique~/~.##Le rocher s'effondre après ~w~5~/~ tours consécutifs hors de vue ou après ~w~2~/~ tours sans Énergie du lanceur.##La limite de base est de ~w~3~/~ rochers, chaque autre compétence de Géomancie débloquée l'augmente de ~w~1~/~.##Les rochers du même lanceur à ~w~7~/~ cases ou moins s'attirent, entrent en collision, repoussent les unités sur le trajet et infligent des ~p~dégâts bruts~/~.;Summons a ~w~Runic Boulder~/~. The boulder pulls enemies in a ~w~5x5~/~ area toward its landing point and deals ~p~/*Arcane_Damage*/ True Damage~/~.##Each visible boulder grants the caster 1 stack of ~lg~Runic Power~/~.##The boulder collapses after staying outside the caster's vision for ~w~5~/~ consecutive turns or after the caster has no Energy for ~w~2~/~ consecutive turns.##Base limit is ~w~3~/~ boulders, each other opened Geomancy skill increases it by ~w~1~/~.##Boulders owned by the same caster wi